  "title": "The Fur Rondy World Championship",
  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"post-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2012-01-06\" class=\"post-date entry-date updated\">January 6, 2012</time>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"post-title entry-title\"><a href=\"/the-fur-rondy-world-championship\">The Fur Rondy World Championship</a></h1>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"post-meta entry-meta\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"post-author\"><span class=\"author vcard\"><a class=\"url fn n\" href=\"/author/kathy\" rel=\"author\">kathy</a></span></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"post-category\"><a href=\"/category/main\" rel=\"category tag\">main</a></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\n        \t\t\t\t<!--themify_builder_content-->\n<div id=\"themify_builder_content-378\" data-postid=\"378\" class=\"themify_builder_content themify_builder_content-378 themify_builder tf_clear\">\n    \t<!-- module_row -->\n\t<div data-lazy=\"1\" class=\"module_row themify_builder_row tb_vac0797 tb_first tf_clearfix\">\n\t    \t\t<div class=\"row_inner col_align_top col-count-1 tf_box tf_w tf_rel\">\n\t\t\t<div data-lazy=\"1\" class=\"module_column tb-column col-full first tb_8cbf798 tf_box\">\n\t\t\t    \t        <div class=\"tb-column-inner tf_box tf_w\">\n\t\t    <!-- module text -->\n<div class=\"module module-text tb_tcyz757   \" data-lazy=\"1\">\n        <div class=\"tb_text_wrap\">\n    <figure id=\"attachment_748\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-748\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"><a href=\"/images/attla/2012/02/bbfurrondy.jpg\"><img class=\"wp-image-748 attla-content-img\" src=\"/images/attla/2012/02/bbfurrondy.jpg\" alt=\"2010.02-Birdsall, Byron WATERCOLOR of 75th Rondy\"></a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-748\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">2010.02-Birdsall, Byron WATERCOLOR of 75th Rondy (George Attla running Egil Ellis team)</figcaption></figure>\n<h3><strong>THE RACE </strong><em>(Excerpts)<br></em></h3>\n<p>Get a glimpse of the thrill of high-speed sled dog racing as told by Alaska’s most accomplished sprint racer, George Attla. The Fur Rendezvous Championship Sled Dog Race is considered the most challenging 3-day sprint race in the world. As part of a larger event, the race is held every February in Anchorage, Alaska.</p>\n<p>=</p>    </div>\n</div>\n<!-- /module text --><!-- module video -->\n<div class=\"module module-video tb_l3mk661 video-top  \" data-lazy=\"1\" data-url=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JVzZxO-Rh8Y\">\n    \t\t\t\t<div class=\"video-wrap-outer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"video-wrap tf_rel tf_overflow\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<!-- /video-wrap -->\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<!-- /video-wrap-outer -->\n\t\t\t</div>\n<!-- module text -->\n<div class=\"module module-text tb_i8jd470   \" data-lazy=\"1\">\n        <div class=\"tb_text_wrap\">\n    <figure id=\"attachment_751\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-751\" class=\"wp-caption alignleft\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"><a href=\"/images/attla/2012/02/rondypin.jpg\"><img class=\"wp-image-751 attla-content-img\" src=\"/images/attla/2012/02/rondypin.jpg\" alt=\"2008- Waino Gali pin design for Rondy\"></a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-751\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">2008- Waino Gali pin design for Rondy 50th anniversary</figcaption></figure>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>To view the entire program and learn more about<br>the Fur Rendezvous, go to <a href=\"http://www.furrondy.net/\">http://www.furrondy.net/</a>.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/images/attla/2012/02/2008.02-Vehlow-Maxine-of-Susan-Duck-with-George-at-Rondy1.jpg\"><img src=\"/images/attla/2012/02/2008.02-Vehlow-Maxine-of-Susan-Duck-with-George-at-Rondy1.jpg\" class=\"tf_svg_lazy wp-image-1841 alignright attla-content-img\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em>George Attla wants to extend a very</em><br><em>special thanks to Susan Duck,</em><br><em>Fur Rendezvous Executive Director,</em><br><em>for her extraordinary dedication</em><br><em>and hard&nbsp; work to keep the race alive</em>. &nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>THANK YOU SUSAN!</strong></p>    </div>\n</div>\n<!-- /module text --><!-- module text -->\n<div class=\"module module-text tb_66a0773   \" data-lazy=\"1\">\n        <div class=\"tb_text_wrap\">\n    <h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Fur Rendezvous Past Winners: 1946 – 2011</h3>\n<table style=\"height: 2230px;\" border=\"0\" width=\"536\" cellspacing=\"5\" cellpadding=\"5\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Year</td>\n<td>Musher</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2011</td>\n<td>\n<div>• Egil Ellis</div>\n</td>\n<td>1976</td>\n<td>• George Attla</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2010</td>\n<td>• Blayne Streeper</td>\n<td>1975</td>\n<td>• George Attla</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2009</td>\n<td>• Blayne Streeper</td>\n<td>1974</td>\n<td>• Roland Lombard</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2008</td>\n<td>• Blayne Streeper</td>\n<td>1973</td>\n<td>• Carl Huntington</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2007</td>\n<td>• Blayne Streeper</td>\n<td>1972</td>\n<td>• George Attla</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><em>2006</em></td>\n<td><em>• Races cancelled due to lack of snow</em></td>\n<td>1971</td>\n<td>• Roland Lombard</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2005</td>\n<td>• Egil Ellis</td>\n<td>1970</td>\n<td>• Roland Lombard</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2004</td>\n<td>• Blayne Streeper</td>\n<td>1969</td>\n<td>• Roland Lombard</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><em>2003</em></td>\n<td><em>• Races cancelled due to poor track conditions</em></td>\n<td>1968</td>\n<td>• George Attla</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2002</td>\n<td>• Egil Ellis</td>\n<td>1967</td>\n<td>• Roland Lombard</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><em>2001</em></td>\n<td><em>• Races cancelled due to lack of snow</em></td>\n<td>1966</td>\n<td>• Joey Redington, Jr.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2000</td>\n<td>• Egil Ellis</td>\n<td>1965</td>\n<td>• Roland Lombard</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1999</td>\n<td>• Egil Ellis</td>\n<td>1964</td>\n<td>• Roland Lombard</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1998</td>\n<td>• Ross Saunderson</td>\n<td>1963</td>\n<td>• 